sequenceDiagram
  actor Teacher as 教师
  participant C as LabExperimentController
  participant S as LabExperimentService
  participant P as CoursePermissionClient
  participant R as LabExperimentRepository
  participant N as NotificationEventPublisher
  participant L as LRN NotificationService

  Teacher->>C: POST API-LAB-01 创建草稿
  C->>S: createLab(courseId, teacherId, request)
  S->>P: canManageCourse(courseId, teacherId)
  P-->>S: true
  S->>R: save(DRAFT, testcaseList)
  R-->>S: LabExperiment
  S-->>C: 草稿响应
  C-->>Teacher: 201/200 DRAFT

  Teacher->>C: POST API-LAB-06 发布
  C->>S: publishLab(labId, teacherId)
  S->>R: findById(labId)
  R-->>S: DRAFT 实验
  S->>P: canManageCourse(courseId, teacherId)
  P-->>S: true
  S->>R: updateLifecycle(PUBLISHED)
  R-->>S: 已发布实验
  S->>P: listCourseStudentIds(courseId)
  P-->>S: 接收学生编号
  S->>N: publish(LAB_EXPERIMENT_PUBLISHED)
  N->>L: processEvent(event)
  L-->>N: 通知落库结果
  S-->>C: 已发布实验
  C-->>Teacher: PUBLISHED
